 Cup . The Cup Winners ' Cup victory in 1963 made Tottenham the first English team to win a UEFA competition . In 1960 -- 61 , they were the first team to complete The Double in the 20th century .\nPASSAGES>>>\n\nInstructions:\n- Decide whether the claim is supported or refuted. \"answer\" is \"SUPPORTED\" or \"REFUTED\".\n- In \"citations\", list only the labels (P1 to P5) of passages whose text supports your answer, at most 3. If no passage helps, still give your best answer from your own knowledge and leave \"citations\" empty: [].\n- Reply with one JSON object whose fields come in this order: \"reasoning\" (your brief reasoning, at most 600 characters), \"answer\", \"citations\" (a list of passage labels), \"confidence\" (\"high\", \"medium\" or \"low\").\n",
